{"comparisons":[],"failures":[],"frontier":[],"initial":{"normative":{"coverage":[{"reason":"Subject heading.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u0.25812"},{"reason":"Identifies the guidance's audience and its dependence on the Circular and Ordinance.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u1.25828"},{"reason":"Interface control without substantive legal content.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u6.26160"},{"reason":"Interface control without substantive legal content.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u7.26176"},{"reason":"Question numbering.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u12.26234"},{"reason":"Frames the definitions addressed in Q1.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u14.26282"},{"reason":"Answer marker.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u17.26398"},{"reason":"Entity labels and family status do not determine licensing; neither term has an Ordinance definition according to the supplied text.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u18.26414"},{"reason":"Question numbering.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u22.26823"},{"reason":"Frames the Circular-specific single-family-office description.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u24.26871"},{"reason":"Answer marker.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u27.26979"},{"reason":"Provides a typical arrangement, rather than an exhaustive statutory definition or a family-membership licensing test.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u28.26995"},{"reason":"Question numbering.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u32.27512"},{"reason":"Identifies the actor and licensing question for the selected control.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u34.27560"},{"reason":"Answer marker.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u37.27665"},{"reason":"Supplies the three cumulative conditions formalized below.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u38.27681"},{"reason":"Attaches the intra-group carve-out to Type 9 activity classification; its application is an upstream prerequisite.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u39.28171"},{"reason":"Requires case-specific business assessment and supplies qualified ordinary-course guidance; the profit-objective wording remains uncertain.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u40.28601"},{"reason":"Question numbering.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u45.29570"},{"reason":"Frames the shared-infrastructure circumstances addressed by Q4.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u47.29618"},{"reason":"Answer marker.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u50.29872"},{"reason":"Expressly applies Q3's factors to the Q4 arrangements.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u51.29888"},{"reason":"Infrastructure sharing alone is insufficient; investment-resource sharing creates a qualified classification and licensing concern.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u53.30093"},{"reason":"Question numbering.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u58.30734"},{"reason":"Frames the multi-family-office definition and licensing question.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u60.30782"},{"reason":"Answer marker.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u63.30942"},{"reason":"Reports the Circular's multi-family-office description; the Circular itself is absent.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u64.30958"},{"reason":"Extends primary reliance on Q3's factors to multi-family offices without making their typical commercial character conclusive.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u65.31118"},{"reason":"Identifies an update date, not an express commencement or applicability date.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u80.31413"}],"dimensions":[{"dimension":"scope","explanation":"Q3 directly addresses a single family office. Q4 applies its factors to cooperating offices; Q5 makes them the primary determinants for multi-family offices. Labels and family membership do not themselves determine licensing.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u18.26414","daa1876316641.u28.26995","daa1876316641.u34.27560","daa1876316641.u51.29888","daa1876316641.u53.30093","daa1876316641.u64.30958","daa1876316641.u65.31118"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"definitions","explanation":"The packet distinguishes typical office descriptions from statutory definitions. Regulated activity depends on the absent Ordinance. Carrying on a business in Hong Kong requires judgment on the case facts; the listed considerations are not expressly independent Boolean prerequisites.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u18.26414","daa1876316641.u28.26995","daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601","daa1876316641.u64.30958"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"The Type 9 carve-out concerns regulated-activity classification and requires services solely to the specified related entities. It is not expressed as a universal exemption for all activities. Q3's ordinary-course business guidance is qualified, and the attachment of the negation to the profit-objective phrase is unclear.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u39.28171","daa1876316641.u40.28601"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"All three Q3 factors are mandatory for the stated trigger. By contrast, 'should not in the ordinary course', 'may be regarded', 'typically', and 'primarily' preserve qualifications and do not establish automatic exemptions or licensing triggers.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601","daa1876316641.u53.30093","daa1876316641.u65.31118"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"2020-01-07 identifies the referenced Circular and 2020-09-08 identifies the page update. Neither supplies an express commencement date or establishes present applicability.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u1.25828","daa1876316641.u80.31413"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"The Ordinance and Circular are referenced but not supplied. The packet also lists unresolved dependency missing.b8f9c69dd226e4db3f4557d7 without identifying its contents. Internal Q3 and Q5 references can be followed within the packet; external definitions and authority cannot be verified.","source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u1.25828","daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u39.28171","daa1876316641.u51.29888","daa1876316641.u53.30093","daa1876316641.u64.30958","daa1876316641.u65.31118"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["What materials are represented by missing.b8f9c69dd226e4db3f4557d7, and which versions of the Ordinance and Circular govern the assessment?","In Q3's phrase 'or have the pursuit of profit as its business objective', does the earlier negation extend to having a profit objective, or does 'or' introduce a separate qualifying limb?","What case facts and professional assessment establish business character and the Hong Kong connection for the same services?","For what assessment date is this proposed interpretation intended? The page update alone does not establish temporal applicability."],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The selected control tests satisfaction of Q3's stated licensing trigger, not licence possession, unlawful unlicensed conduct, or overall legal compliance.","Any applicable regulated-activity carve-out has been resolved before supplying regulated_services.","The three facts concern the same office, services, business and assessment circumstances.","The formalization represents the stated trigger as the conjunction of its three factors; it does not assert an exhaustive account of obligations under the absent Ordinance.","Q3's qualified ordinary-course guidance informs the business assessment and is not converted into an unconditional exemption."],"citations":[{"quote":"three key factors, all of which must be present in order to give rise to a licensing obligation","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u38.27681"},{"quote":"firstly, the services provided by the family office constitute one or more regulated activity as defined under the Ordinance; secondly, the family office is carrying on a business in the provision of such services; and thirdly, the business is carried on in Hong Kong.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u38.27681"},{"quote":"the licensing regime does not hinge on whether an entity is called a family office or whether its clients are families.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u18.26414"},{"quote":"the definition of Type 9 regulated activity contains an intra-group carve-out","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u39.28171"},{"quote":"will need to be determined by reference to the facts of each case","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u40.28601"},{"quote":"should not in the ordinary course be considered as carrying on a business from a licensing perspective.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u40.28601"},{"quote":"would apply equally in these circumstances.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u51.29888"},{"quote":"will be primarily determined by the three key factors set out in the response to Q3.","unit_id":"daa1876316641.u65.31118"}],"distinction":"The source supports one clear conjunctive structure for the selected control. The material unresolved differences concern how the business fact is supplied, especially whether the profit-objective phrase falls within the negation, and how upstream regulated-activity exclusions apply. Those differences can change the trigger's result without changing its three-factor formula. Office labels, infrastructure sharing, or typical commercial character do not substitute for establishing the factors.","family":"modality","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"For the assessed office and services, at least one service constitutes a regulated activity under the applicable Ordinance after resolving applicable carve-outs. This is a supplied classification, not inferred solely from the family-office label.","name":"regulated_services","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u18.26414","daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u39.28171"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification"},{"meaning":"The assessed office is carrying on a business in providing those services, determined from the case facts with Q3's listed considerations and qualified ordinary-course guidance retained. No single income, profit, or continuity consideration is treated here as automatically decisive.","name":"services_as_business","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification"},{"meaning":"The business providing those same services is carried on in Hong Kong, assessed on the relevant case facts. This is not merely the location of clients, investments, or shared premises.","name":"business_in_hong_kong","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["daa1876316641.u38.27681","daa1876316641.u40.28601"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean territorial classification"}],"result":"(and regulated_services services_as_business business_in_hong_kong)","result_type":"bool","scope":"true"},"local_id":"q3_three_factor_trigger","questions":["Does the intended reading of the ordinary-course passage require both absence of business income beyond expense reimbursement and absence of a profit objective? The supplied grammar does not settle that safely.","Have all relevant regulated activities been assessed after the Type 9 carve-out, rather than treating that carve-out as an exemption from every licensing category?","Does the absent governing material impose additional qualifications beyond this selected three-factor trigger?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For the selected control only, true means the office satisfies all three stated conditions for Q3's licensing trigger: regulated services after carve-outs, carrying on a business in those services, and carrying on that business in Hong Kong. The tag denotes satisfaction of this trigger predicate; it does not mean that the office holds a required licence or complies with licensing law. Unknown classifications remain unknown.","subject":"Q3 three-factor licensing trigger after regulated-activity carve-outs"}]}},"java_checks":[],"live_provider":true,"model_calls":2,"no_progress":0,"nodes":[],"pending":null,"provider_id":"codex.fresh.v1.compact.v1","retrievals":[],"rounds":0,"roundtrips":[],"run_id":"run.98deff83a1104c269f71172a12f08a93","stop":null}